  speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd422fef7c7a0976bcb3c39364963115, type: 2}
  descriptionLocalized:
    english: "Treasurer: 'Sire, pacifying this conquered territory is bleeding our coffers dry. We need a war levy on their local merchants immediately.'"
    arabic: "أمين الخزينة: «يا مولاي، إحكام السيطرة على هذه الأراضي يستنزف خزائننا! يجب فرض ضريبة حرب على تجارهم فوراً.»"
  dayAdvance: 1
  leftChoiceLocalized:
    english: "Tax them mercilessly; war must pay for war."
    arabic: "افرض الضرائب بلا رحمة؛ فالحرب تطعم نفسها."
  leftResourceChange:
    values:
    - resource: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b891174f857049f44be00b474746951e, type: 2}
      value: 5
    - resource: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1bd4e23f03990bc4d9ab64de0475c474, type: 2}
      value: 15
    - resource: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10d39ca6ec17c4442b381bbfe0578b71, type: 2}
      value: -10
  leftNextCard: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6a41b69550b13f87d4ccd7da33550799, type: 2}
  rightChoiceLocalized:
    english: "Spare their commerce; establish fair border tolls."
    arabic: "اعفُ تجارتهم؛ واكتفِ برسوم جمركية عادلة."
  rightResourceChange:
